- Audit report. PASS, 0 blockers, 0 majors, 10 minors; the minor set, the 0.25 mm tick at column x=142 rows 0 to 58, pages p96, p132, p134, p94, and the room-scene pages match the addendum.
- Pages. Week blocks start at 4, 22, 40, 58, 76, 94, 112 and week 8 is 130 to 136, so the reader sides are 9+18(n-1) to 20+18(n-1), 84 sides; with 2 lead sheets the fold test holds 86 pages. make-fold-test-lead-pdf.ts takes --out, needs an absolute path, allows /tmp/opencode/, and refuses a PDF that is not 2 pages. check-qr.ts takes --level, --out, and a positional PDF.
- Code-test list. All 11 rows name real test names and real paths. The names S-words-%s, S-words-mutants, S-all, S-weeks, S-a-up, D-all, D-letters, D-mutants, W-layout, both decodable names, P-write, T-rule, K-taught, both dictation names, the S4 and S5 names, the S8 name, U9-file, U9-book, U8-pages, U4-map, U6-pages, H1-classes and the other H1-* names, the teacher-book name, and Q-roundtrip, Q-mutant, Q-two, Q-compare, Q-expected were found by masked grep.
